@startuml CoSimComponent_Lifecycle

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam participantPadding 60

participant "User /\nSystem" as User
participant "Concrete\nComponent" as Sub
participant "CoSimComponent\n(Base Class)" as Base

== Construction ==

User -> Sub: **create(name, ...)**
activate Sub

Sub -> Base: super().__init__(name)
activate Base
Base -> Base: Initialize port containers,\nparameters, history recorder
Base --> Sub
deactivate Base

Sub -> Sub: Define input_specs, output_specs
Sub -> Sub: Define default parameters

Sub -> Base: _initialize_ports_from_specs()
activate Base
note right: Create PortState objects\nfrom registered PortSpecs
Base --> Sub
deactivate Base

Sub --> User
deactivate Sub

== Initialization ==

User -> Base: **initialize(t0)**
activate Base

Base -> Base: Set time, create event ports

Base -> Sub: **_initialize_component(t0)**
activate Sub
note left: //abstract//\nLoad model, configure solver,\nset initial state
Sub --> Base
deactivate Sub

Base -> Base: _detect_direct_feedthrough()

Base -> Sub: **_update_output_states(t0)**
activate Sub
note left: //abstract//\nWrite internal state\nto output ports
Sub --> Base
deactivate Sub

Base -> Base: _record_outputs(t0)

Base --> User
deactivate Base

== Simulation Step ==

User -> Base: **do_step(t, dt)**
activate Base

Base -> Sub: **_do_step_internal(t, dt)**
activate Sub
note left: //abstract//\nAdvance internal solver\nfrom t to t+dt
Sub --> Base
deactivate Sub

Base -> Base: Update time: t = t + dt

Base -> Sub: **_update_output_states(t)**
activate Sub
Sub --> Base
deactivate Sub

Base -> Base: _record_outputs(t)

Base --> User
deactivate Base

@enduml
